WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open the roster maker with roster-management access and select the week.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.750
Step 2: Choose Staff, Stacked or Day view. Add a shift inside a day/staff cell and set its time, person and position.

3
00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:21.208
Step 3: Move shifts with their grip; drag a Day-view bar to change staff or time. Check overlap or availability warnings.

4
00:00:21.208 --> 00:00:37.708
Step 4: Review the autosave status and the cost on each shift card. Staff view also shows each person’s weekly total. Click a cost for its calculation or the details needed to price it. Select a shift’s background and use Delete or Backspace to remove it; use Undo if needed.

5
00:00:37.708 --> 00:00:43.708
Step 5: Use Copy previous week when appropriate, review the resulting draft and publish separately.
